==Release information==
This card was one of five that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 8 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Alolan Ninetales Drop Event]], which ran from May 16 to 26, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Grimer}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Alolan Grimer|57}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
* {{m|Poison Gas}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that Alolan Grimer can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

